<h2>1. General</h2>
<p>These Terms of Use (the “Terms”) govern the relationship between the owner of {{ site_name }} (the “Site”, “we”) and its users. By using the Site you agree to the Terms and the <a href="{{ path('app_privacy') }}">Privacy Policy</a>. The Russian version of this document prevails.</p>

<h2>2. Services</h2>
<p>The Site provides information about kayak rental and rafting trips on Belarusian rivers and lets you send a booking request or ask for a call back.</p>

<h2>3. Registration</h2>
<p>Booking does not require an account. Registered users see and manage their bookings in the personal account. You need to confirm your email address before signing in, and you are responsible for keeping your password safe.</p>

<h2>4. Booking and cancellation</h2>
<ul>
    <li>A request on the Site is not a final confirmation: our team will contact you to agree on the details and the price. After that the booking gets the “Confirmed” status.</li>
    <li>Prices on the Site are indicative; the final price is agreed on confirmation.</li>
    <li>You can cancel an upcoming booking free of charge in your personal account, via the link in the confirmation email or by phone.</li>
    <li>In case of bad weather or a safety risk we may reschedule the trip and offer another date.</li>
</ul>

<h2>5. Payment</h2>
<p>No payments are made on the Site. Payment is arranged with our representative after the booking is confirmed.</p>

<h2>6. Safety on the water</h2>
<p>Participants must follow the <a href="{{ path('app_info') }}#safety">safety rules</a> and the instructions of the guide and wear life jackets. Minors take part only accompanied by adults.</p>

<h2>7. Reviews</h2>
<p>After the trip you can leave a review. Reviews are published after moderation; we may reject a review containing insults, advertising or personal data of other people.</p>

